---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div
    class="mx-auto min-h-screen max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 text-foreground md:px-8"
  >
    <h1 class="mb-6 animate-fade-up text-4xl font-semibold">Contact</h1>
    <div class="flex animate-fade-up animation-delay-100 flex-col gap-8 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        For enquiries about my work, projects, or professional experience, email
        {" "}
        <a
          href="mailto:admin@m4t.tf"
          class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground/70"
          >admin@m4t.tf</a
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        Including the context of your enquiry, such as the role, project, or
        question you have in mind, makes it easier to reply with something
        useful.
      </p>
      <p>
        For verified facts about my background, the <a
          href="/cv"
          class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground/70">CV</a
        > is the primary source: it lists my experience, technical strengths, education,
        and projects.
      </p>
      <p>
        My software projects and open-source work are available on
        {" "}
        <a
          href="https://github.com/ma-tf"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground/70"
          >GitHub</a
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        Email is the only contact channel I publish. There is no contact form,
        phone number, or second inbox, so treat any other channel claiming to
        reach me as unofficial.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
